WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.933
Welcome to Module 3 of Defender
X D R Engineering and Operations:

2
00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.775
exposure and incidents.

3
00:00:06.775 --> 00:00:10.006
Two queues decide whether the
platform you built is used:

4
00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:14.750
the vulnerabilities waiting for an owner,
and the incidents waiting for an analyst.

5
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:18.343
In this module you learn what
Defender adds to the vulnerability

6
00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:21.338
program in a government cloud,
and what it can't do there.

7
00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:25.996
Then you learn how the security
operations center triages, contains,

8
00:00:25.996 --> 00:00:29.837
hands off and closes every
incident, to a table it can show.

9
00:00:29.837 --> 00:00:35.112
The module covers Steps 5 and 6 of the
Defender X D R implementation guide.

10
00:00:35.112 --> 00:00:39.650
It takes about thirty-five minutes,
plus Lab 2 in your own test tenant.
